From 1ddeaf296b089fea1a6f646cb02a8e0f8b92ab94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: virtualAxe <virtualaxe@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:37:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] virtual axeos: support qemu partitions and openeth ui

Why: provide the partition map and loopback/OpenETH UI behavior needed by the
real AxeOS bundle when it is served from the QEMU firmware image.
Virtual-only: partition wrappers are linked only for CONFIG_BITAXE_VIRTUAL; the
frontend adapts from runtime networkType metadata.
Upstream surface: main CMake linkage, ESP partition lookup, HTTP origin
handling, and the AxeOS network-edit component.
Verify: run make build, API settings tests, and browser smoke tests.
Removal impact: virtual firmware partition lookup and local AxeOS networking
flows can fail or mislead users.
---
